# Pinned in .github/workflows/repo-checks.yml (clang-format 21.1.8).
# Google C++ style: 2-space indent, 80 columns, attached braces, left-aligned
# pointers, sorted includes, reflowed comments.
# Include blocks stay as written: Win32 headers require <windows.h> before the
# other system headers, and regrouping would sort it to the end.
---
Language: Cpp
Standard: c++17
BasedOnStyle: Google
IncludeBlocks: Preserve
